Accept connection resets in the TLS 1.3 wrong-certificate test

The server rejects the invalid client certificate and closes the socket.
Depending on the platform, the client may see a TCP reset or broken pipe
instead of an SSL exception. Accept these expected socket errors while
checking the error message.
